  "question": "Where is the nearest caf\u00e9 along the corridor from Caldwell Woods, Chicago, IL to Fox Meadow Park, South Elgin, IL?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.786491 41.997567)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.321054 42.002492)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'cafe'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.786491 41.997567)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.786491 41.997567)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
